sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Participant
    actor O as Organizer
    participant W as Web app
    participant MS as Match service
    participant D as Database

    P->>W: Leave
    W->>MS: leaveMatch(matchId, userId)
    alt Not a participant, or user is the organizer
        MS-->>W: Refused (organizer must cancel)
    else Participant
        MS->>D: Delete MATCH_PARTICIPANT row
        opt Match was full
            MS->>D: Set status open
        end
        MS-->>W: Left
    end
    O->>W: Cancel Match
    W->>MS: cancelMatch(matchId, userId)
    alt User is not the organizer, or match already completed or cancelled
        MS-->>W: Refused
    else Organizer
        MS->>D: Set status cancelled (slot is free again)
        MS-->>W: Cancelled, removed from list and history
    end
